            "kind": "executable",
            "description": "# Payment of the NFC subsidy\nAccording to the previously approved grant for DAO members attending the Non Fungible Conference in Lisbon, Apenzl is to be paid for his travel expenses and Palheiro for the reservation of the apartment where the whole team stayed.\n\nThe payment to Apenzl is $300 as per the grant, payable in wETH ($150), GEM ($75) and MANA ($75). At current prices this equates to:\n\n0.043 wETH\n\n11078 GEM\n\n7965 MANA\n\n\n\nFor the apartment, the total cost was €566, but the DAO only covers $500, so the payment will be:\n\n0.14 wETH\n\n\n\nInvoices justifying these payments are available to DAO members on request. This proposal can be discussed in the private Discord channel and in the forum [thread](https://dao.mythicalbeings.io/forum/post/nfc_lisbon_subsidy_proposal_4rrloich \"forum thread\").",
